{"ticker":"AVY","updated":"2026-11-13T22:40:05Z","profile":{"longName":"Avery Dennison Corporation","shortName":"Avery Dennison Corporation","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Packaging & Containers","country":"United States","website":"https://www.averydennison.com","fullTimeEmployees":35000,"marketCap":14198416384,"trailingPE":20.349567,"forwardPE":16.972713,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.5162606,"pegRatio":1.92,"targetMeanPrice":203.3,"targetHighPrice":230.0,"targetLowPrice":182.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":10,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.052,"earningsGrowth":0.051,"grossMargins":0.2883,"operatingMargins":0.12762,"profitMargins":0.07564,"totalRevenue":9364100096,"beta":0.776,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":199.54,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":152.42,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.14},"summary":"Avery Dennison Corporation operates as a materials science and digital identification solutions company in the North America, Europe, the Middle East, North Africa, Asia, and Latin America. It offers pressure-sensitive label materials, which consist of papers, plastic films, and metal foils; performance tapes products, including mechanical fasteners, which are precision-extruded and injection-molded plastic devices; and other pressure-sensitive adhesive-based materials and converted products under the Fasson, JAC, and Avery Dennison brands. The company provides graphics and reflective products that include films and other products for the architectural, commercial sign, digital printing, and other related market segments; durable cast and reflective films to the construction, automotive, and fleet transportation markets; sign shops, commercial printers, and designers for pressure-sensitive materials; reflective films for traffic and safety applications; and pressure-sensitive vinyl and specialty materials for digital imaging, screen printing, and sign cutting applications under the Avery Dennison and Mactac brand names. In addition, it offers branding solutions, which include brand embellishments, graphic tickets, tags, labels, and sustainable packaging; information solutions, such as item-level RFID, visibility and loss prevention, price ticketing and marking, productivity and","summary_zh":"艾利丹尼森公司是一家材料科學和數位識別解決方案公司，業務遍及北美、歐洲、中東、北非、亞洲和拉丁美洲。它提供壓敏標籤材料，包括紙張、塑膠薄膜和金屬箔；高性能膠帶產品，包括機械緊固件，這是精密擠壓和注塑成型的塑膠裝置；以及 Fasson、JAC 和 Avery Dennison 品牌下的其他壓敏黏合劑材料和轉換產品。該公司為建築、商業標誌、數位印刷和其他相關細分市場提供圖形和反光產品，包括薄膜和其他產品；為建築、汽車和車隊運輸市場提供耐用的流延膜和反光膜；標誌店、商業印刷商和壓敏材料設計師；用於交通和安全應用的反光膜；以及艾利丹尼森和 Mactac 品牌下用於數位使用乙烯基壓力結構的結構此外，它還提供品牌解決方案，包括品牌裝飾、圖形門票、吊牌、標籤和可持續包裝；資訊解決方案，例如物品級 RFID、可視性和防損、價格票務和標記、生產力和","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh":"包裝與容器","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":166.05,"h":166.76,"l":163.9,"c":164.85,"v":685700},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":164.6,"h":166.61,"l":164.58,"c":166.23,"v":656800},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":166.67,"h":169.47,"l":164.37,"c":164.94,"v":723600},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":164.83,"h":167.15,"l":164.74,"c":165.04,"v":970500},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":165.79,"h":165.99,"l":163.97,"c":164.38,"v":1316700},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":164.7,"h":164.9,"l":162.73,"c":163.2,"v":591700},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":163.24,"h":164.76,"l":162.92,"c":163.32,"v":647600},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":163.08,"h":164.17,"l":161.28,"c":162.22,"v":481800},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":160.98,"h":162.63,"l":158.51,"c":158.71,"v":458200},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":159.23,"h":161.03,"l":159.01,"c":160.75,"v":403400},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":161.13,"h":161.21,"l":159.82,"c":160.42,"v":449200},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":159.38,"h":162.36,"l":159.13,"c":162.17,"v":711600},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":161.5,"h":163.27,"l":161.5,"c":162.49,"v":817500},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":162.16,"h":163.52,"l":162.01,"c":162.68,"v":505100},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":162.9,"h":164.09,"l":162.09,"c":163.44,"v":493800},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":162.69,"h":163.46,"l":161.9,"c":162.75,"v":608400},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":162.97,"h":163.43,"l":159.68,"c":161.37,"v":576900},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":161.6,"h":162.58,"l":160.95,"c":161.96,